<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel final deal for later - Paris court.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel final deal for later - Paris court.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris commercial court said on Wednesday it had been informed that Eurotunnel and the lead negotiators for the banks to whom it owes massive debts had drawn up &quot;the main lines of an agreement&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The parties told the president of the Paris commercial court they hoped to submit a definitive protocol at a later date,&quot; said a brief statement from the court.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
